                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Smokeys"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "016a8a3f-6bb6-38ec-9121-e8bd236f6de0",
                        "entry_id": "a2bd5fbd-1b86-3bb4-8225-96e6ac4d5e54",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of Smokey Bear."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a40d67d6-ca3b-4d84-bcbf-e8368044215f",
                                "sense_id": "016a8a3f-6bb6-38ec-9121-e8bd236f6de0",
                                "text": "The plush bear on the near left was produced by Three Bears Inc. around 1985 and is typical of the plush Smokeys produced in the United States."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9915d89d-d6dc-47ac-bb2e-a233372facfc",
                                "sense_id": "016a8a3f-6bb6-38ec-9121-e8bd236f6de0",
                                "text": "Ideal released several more plush Smokeys, but the company's most ingenious move was to include application cards allowing kids to become a \"Junior Forest Ranger.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "b62f49bf-f709-3096-a3bb-d39aaffcd7ad",
                "word": "smokey",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "dd415811-1075-460c-b84e-97ebcca7a794",
                        "entry_id": "b62f49bf-f709-3096-a3bb-d39aaffcd7ad",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "smokies"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "de0473bc-e182-4f69-820c-51974369e79f",
                        "entry_id": "b62f49bf-f709-3096-a3bb-d39aaffcd7ad",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "smokeys"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e23639ff-3b29-3134-b7cf-726dcd830bbf",
                        "entry_id": "b62f49bf-f709-3096-a3bb-d39aaffcd7ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A state trooper. By extension, a cop, police officer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05a5f359-117d-4fd2-acf8-201946d57ebb",
                                "sense_id": "e23639ff-3b29-3134-b7cf-726dcd830bbf",
                                "text": "By the time we got into Tulsa Town\nWe had eighty-five trucks in all\nBut there's a roadblock up on the cloverleaf\nAnd them bears was wall-to-wall.\nYeah, them smokies is thick as bugs on a bumper\nThey even had a bear in the air."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db09aec1-dc41-4887-a171-73853aef0ded",
                                "sense_id": "e23639ff-3b29-3134-b7cf-726dcd830bbf",
                                "text": "The middle position, or \"rocking chair,\" is so called because the drivers in the middle don't have to worry about watching for smokeys."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ee80d78-6058-4ead-875c-bb9418d9f65a",
                                "sense_id": "e23639ff-3b29-3134-b7cf-726dcd830bbf",
                                "text": "I was keeping an eye out for the smokeys who were no doubt hiding and waiting for unsuspecting tourists on the way in from Jacksonville."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33c008b4-f1de-496b-aab4-10b0d851a9ae",
                                "sense_id": "e23639ff-3b29-3134-b7cf-726dcd830bbf",
                                "text": "Well let me tell you why I came, Crash: I need something from you, tonight. I had a four-man team for a big grab, lost one to smokies. I came looking to replace him, if you're still a badass."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c6e0c97-6be6-4d49-a37e-95a5f0e8c17f",
                        "source_entry_id": "b62f49bf-f709-3096-a3bb-d39aaffcd7ad",
                        "source_sense_id": "e23639ff-3b29-3134-b7cf-726dcd830bbf",
